      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STRIKE IT MIKE (1) was a winner two back then strongly fancied last time but could only manage a second (22.55) at this track. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Expected to feature in the finish again. ZARA'S SECRET (7) goes very well this course and distance starting seven times for three wins and three minors. In the money last time at this track (18.00) in a Grade 3/4, finishing a 3 length second. Suited here and expected to run well. CONTROL BUBBA (5) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 3 lengths at this track in a handy 17.79 beating ZARA'S SECRET. Likely to be in the finish. HOORAY CARTER (2) gets a chance to improve on an unplaced run at his latest outing at this circuit.",
